   ],
   "fitness_value_in_ancestor": "the effective branching factor drops from ~35 toward ~6 with good ordering",
   "failure_landscape": "by reading: no transposition table, no null move, no futility: the 1997 minimum; the horizon effect is handled only by quiescence",
